# Android Studio / IntelliJ
android/.idea/
.idea/

# Signing & Google services (never commit)
*.jks
*.keystore
google-services.json

# Debug screenshots, not product
.cursor/video-frames/

# Local planning notes (not product)
.archive/
scope-plan.md
*.plan.md

# Local-only folders
docs/

# Built APKs / bundles (keep copies in releases/, never commit)
*.apk
*.aab
releases/*
!releases/README.md
